# .env.example — AWARENISTIC
# Everett's standing rule: no .env in this house. Keys go in the box in the interface (POST /keys)
# and live in memory for the run. This file exists because the being protocol requires every
# variable to be documented. Nothing here is required to run.
#
# AWARENISTIC_PORT=3600            Port the local door listens on. Default 3600. Always 127.0.0.1.
# AWARENISTIC_LEDGER=awarenistic-ledger.jsonl   Where the person's own record is kept, on their device.
#
# Twilio account SID and auth token are NOT environment variables. They are entered through the
# interface and never written to disk. (Cardinal Rule 12, Rule 15.)
